        <h2>Fabrication Capabilities for Project Steelwork</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai operates a production base equipped for precision steel truss fabrication, with documented quality processes and export-oriented packing and delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="capability-grid">
        <div class="capability-item reveal">
          <h4>CNC Cutting</h4>
          <p>Precision CNC plasma and flame cutting for truss members, gusset plates and connection plates with accurate dimensions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Drilling</h4>
          <p>CNC drilling for bolt holes in gusset plates, connection plates and member end connections with accurate hole positioning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Welding</h4>
          <p>Qualified welding procedures and welders for fillet, partial penetration and full penetration welds per project specifications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal">
          <h4>Assembly</h4>
          <p>Precision truss assembly including member fitting, node alignment and jig assembly for accurate geometry control.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Dimensional Inspection</h4>
          <p>Dimensional verification at critical fabrication stages, including truss geometry, node positions and connection fit-up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Trial Assembly</h4>
          <p>Trial assembly for complex trusses where required by project specification, verifying fit-up and connection alignment before shipment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal">
          <h4>Surface Preparation</h4>
          <p>Shot blasting and surface preparation per SA 2.5 or project-specified standards before coating application.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Painting</h4>
          <p>Multi-coat paint systems including primer, intermediate and finish coats, with dry film thickness verification per specification.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Galvanizing</h4>
          <p>Hot-dip galvanizing coordination for truss members suitable for galvanizing bath dimensions, per applicable standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal">
          <h4>Component Marking</h4>
          <p>Unique truss and member identification system matching assembly drawings, including piece marks, orientation and connection references.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Export Packing</h4>
          <p>Packing organized for container shipping, with detailed packing lists, truss member inventory and handling instructions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
        <a href="/en/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">View Manufacturing & Quality →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 06 / Connections & Structural Interfaces -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">Connections</p>
        <h2>Connections and Structural Interfaces</h2>
        <p>Steel truss connections and structural interfaces are critical to project performance. Connection design is coordinated based on project structural drawings and applicable standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="connection-grid">
        <div class="connection-item reveal">
          <h4>Welded Connections</h4>
          <p>Gusset plate welded connections for angle steel trusses, and direct welded CHS/RHS connections for pipe trusses. Welding per qualified WPS and project inspection requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connection-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Bolted Connections</h4>
          <p>High-strength bolted connections for site-assembled trusses, including bolt grade specification, hole tolerances and tightening procedures per project requirements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connection-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Splice Joints</h4>
          <p>Truss splice joints for transport segmentation, designed for load transfer and site assembly accuracy. Splice locations optimized for transport and erection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connection-item reveal">
          <h4>Base Plates</h4>
          <p>Truss support base plates and bearing connections, including anchor bolt interfaces and load transfer to supporting columns or foundations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connection-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Gusset Plates</h4>
          <p>Custom gusset plates for multi-member connection nodes, with precise hole positioning and weld preparation for accurate truss assembly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="connection-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Building Interfaces</h4>
          <p>Coordination with building structural system including column connections, bracing interfaces, roof system support and lateral load transfer paths.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 07 / Surface Treatment -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">Surface Treatment</p>
        <h2>Surface Treatment for Truss Structures</h2>
        <p>Surface protection systems are selected based on project environment, corrosion category, client specifications and design life requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-grid">
        <div class="surface-card reveal">
          <h4>Painting Systems</h4>
          <p>Multi-coat paint systems including epoxy primer, epoxy intermediate and polyurethane finish coats. System selection based on corrosion category and project specifications, with dry film thickness verification.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="surface-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Hot-Dip Galvanizing</h4>
          <p>Hot-dip galvanizing for truss members and components suitable for galvanizing bath dimensions. Provides durable corrosion protection for exterior and industrial environments, per applicable standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="surface-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h4>Project-Specific Coating</h4>
          <p>Specialized coating systems for corrosive industrial environments, including high-performance epoxy, polyurethane and fluoropolymer coatings per project specifications and environmental requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px; background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534; font-size: 0.9rem;"><strong>Note:</strong> Specific corrosion protection system is determined by project environment, corrosion category, client specifications, local standards and design life requirements. ZhongSai does not guarantee fixed corrosion-free service life; actual performance depends on environment, maintenance and coating system specification.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

