          <h3>Architectural Drawings</h3>
          <p>Building architectural drawings showing truss layout, span requirements, roof profile and architectural constraints.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">03</div>
          <h3>Structural Drawings</h3>
          <p>Structural design drawings including truss geometry, member sizes, loading specifications and connection design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
