  <!-- 12 / FAQ -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p>Common questions about steel truss fabrication, project capabilities and delivery from ZhongSai.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <h4>Can ZhongSai fabricate steel trusses according to project drawings?</h4>
          <p>Yes. ZhongSai fabricates steel trusses based on client-provided structural drawings and approved shop drawings. We can also coordinate detailing support to develop fabrication drawings based on confirmed structural design. Fabrication proceeds only after approved drawings and confirmed technical specifications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h4>Can you support shop drawing and detailing for truss projects?</h4>
